cmd-hereticascend-desc = Instantly ascend as a heretic on the given path. Debug command for testing ascensions.
cmd-hereticascend-help = hereticascend [path] - makes you a heretic if needed and triggers the ascension. Re-run to replay the cinematic.
cmd-hereticascend-no-entity = You need to be attached to an entity.
cmd-hereticascend-antag-failed = Couldn't make you a heretic. Try running the command again.
cmd-hereticascend-bad-path = No ascension exists for path "{ $path }".
cmd-hereticascend-success = Ascended on the path of { $path }.
cmd-hereticascend-path-hint = <path>
